<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Greet a new friend with a grin!</l><l>Be tenderhearted, kind to one another.</l><l>“Join with us and come right in!”</l><l>Be tenderhearted, kind to one another.</l><l>This game has just begun!</l><l>We have space for every one;</l><l>Including more is fun.</l><l>Be tenderhearted, kind to one another.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
